			<item>
				<title>VisualVM inside Docker container</title>
				<link>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2017-11-23-visual-vm/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 23 Nov 2017 11:22:48 +0800</pubDate>
				<guid>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2017-11-23-visual-vm/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-idea--motivation&#34;&gt;The idea / motivation&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In order to run VisualVM from predefined configuration you need to point the app to the user directory. This directory takes about 20MB, but 90% of the the content is actually generated or repeated.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-gdscript3&#34; data-lang=&#34;gdscript3&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;➜&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;devops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;visualvm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;master&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;du&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sh&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/*&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;244&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;config&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;7.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;modules&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;52&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;repository&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;4.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;update&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;104&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;update_tracking&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;➜&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;devops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;visualvm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;master&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;du&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sh&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/*&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;248&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;config&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;7.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;modules&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;repository&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;4.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;update&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;104&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;update_tracking&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;➜&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;devops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;visualvm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;master&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;du&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;sh&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;wool&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The only part that is specific and worthy of maintaining in the Git repo is repository&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Starting ACC in VM</title>
				<link>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2015-07-15-acc-in-vm/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2015 11:22:48 +0800</pubDate>
				<guid>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2015-07-15-acc-in-vm/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The ACC is installed in default location: &lt;code&gt;~/ATG/ACC11.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This does not work OOTB. You must set 2 additional ENV properties&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-mysql&#34; data-lang=&#34;mysql&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;~/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;ATG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;ACC11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;ACC_HOME&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;pwd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;JAVA_VM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;usr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;java&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;jdk1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;_51&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;bin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;java&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;bin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;startClient&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;starting-from-dynadmin&#34;&gt;Starting from dyn/admin&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The start in separate VM works OK.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Start in server VM brings errors message very often complaining of malformed Help URL.&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://miroadamy.com/images/acc-1.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The issue is documented here: &lt;a href=&#34;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/20868244/how-to-fix-malformed-help-url-while-opening-acc-atg&#34;&gt;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/20868244/how-to-fix-malformed-help-url-while-opening-acc-atg&lt;/a&gt; - for JBOSS.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I tried to add the protocol.jar from DAS/lib into Tomcat lib, but it made no difference.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>ATG Development using &#39;hidden&#39; VM</title>
				<link>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2013-04-22-atg-development/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2013 11:22:48 +0800</pubDate>
				<guid>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2013-04-22-atg-development/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Brief description of my latest setup I use for CPL and LCH - in case I forget it or somebody wants to replicate it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Inspiration for the setup came from &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_embedded&amp;amp;v=cPt_1Vga-Nk&#34;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_embedded&amp;amp;v=cPt_1Vga-Nk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;motivation---issues-with-vms&#34;&gt;Motivation - issues with VMs&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;VMs are great - they allow &amp;ldquo;packaged&amp;rdquo; dev environment and quick start for the new member of the team. Start a VM on local or remote host, connect with VNC or Remote Desktop and you are in business.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
